    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3022" root="بَقَلَ" body-key="b">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابتقل الحِمَارُ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبقّل</span></b> ; (S;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابتقلت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَاشِيَةُ</span>, (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِبِلُ</span>, (JK,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبقّلت</span></b> ; (JK,
K;) <i>The ass,</i> or <i>the beasts,</i> or <i>camels, pastured
upon</i> [<i>plants,</i> or <i>herbs, of the kind called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَقْل</span>:
(S, K:) or <i>became fat from pasturing upon</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بقل</span>.
(JK.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابتقل القَوْمُ</span> <i>The people,</i> or <i>company of men, had their cattle pasturing upon</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَقْل</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبقّلوا</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابقلوا</span></b> : (K:) or <i>they
pastured their cattle upon</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بقل</span>. (JK.)

